{{The Unlikely Inventor}}
Young MARTY McFly lives in the mundane suburb of HILL VALLEY during the year 1985, where he frequently hangs out with an eccentric scientist named DOC BROWN. The scientist, known by the name EMMETT BROWN, has spent his entire professional life working on a bizarre project involving a stainless steel DELOREAN car that serves as a machine for TIME TRAVEL. During a late-night meeting at a local shopping center, DOC reveals his invention, which relies on plutonium stolen from dangerous LIBYAN TERRORISTS. Suddenly, the militants arrive to reclaim their materials, forcing MARTY to jump into the vehicle and hit the throttle to escape. Because he reaches the necessary speed of eighty-eight miles per hour, the car initiates a massive jump through the dimensions of history, landing him directly in the year 1955. This event is a monumental EXPERIMENT that changes his life FOREVER.

